# Build products of arcron-working-guide.md, deliberately not committed.
#
# The tree is otherwise entirely text. A checked-in PDF is a second copy of
# every figure in the book — which is already a third copy of every figure in
# `docs/` — and nothing can tell you when it stopped matching. Run ./build.sh
# when you want a reading copy, or attach one to a release.
arcron-working-guide.pdf
arcron-working-guide.epub
.guide.pdf.md
